  "title": "Bel Fuse Inc. Announces Regular Quarterly Cash Dividend on its Class A and Class B Shares",
  "summary": "WEST ORANGE, N.J., Aug. 03, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BEL FUSE INC. (NASDAQ:BELFA) and (NASDAQ:BELFB) today announced that its Board of Directors has declared regular quarterly cash dividends of $0.06 per share on the Company's Class A common shares and $0.07 per share on the Company's Class B",
